# Project Plan

## Objective
Build a SQL data warehouse using SAMHSA MH-CLD data and a medallion architecture.

## Source
SAMHSA MH-CLD annual CSV dataset.

## Architecture
Source → Bronze → Silver → Gold → Analysis

## Bronze
Ingest raw data while preserving source structure.

## Silver
Clean and standardize the source data.

## Gold
Create dimensional tables and analytical fact tables.

## Validation
Verify row counts, uniqueness, and table relationships.
